ref=f3e1360]: The URLs where your site is accessible.\n                - group \"Site Address\" [ref=f3e1364]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1365]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1367]:\n                      - text: Site Address (URL)\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1368]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1369]:\n                      - textbox \"Site Address (URL)\" [ref=f3e1373]:\n                        - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1374]: The URL where ConvexPress's core files reside.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1375]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1377]:\n                      - text: Home Address (URL)\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1378]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1379]:\n                      - textbox \"Home Address (URL)\" [ref=f3e1383]:\n                        - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1384]: The address visitors use to reach your site.\n                  - note [ref=f3e1385]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1388]: These URLs should only be changed if you know what you're doing. In most cases, the Site Address and Home Address should be the same.\n              - generic [ref=f3e1389]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1390]: Administration\n                - group \"Administration\" [ref=f3e1397]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1398]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1400]:\n                      - text: Administration Email\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1401]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1402]:\n                      - textbox \"Administration Email\" [ref=f3e1406]:\n                        - /placeholder: admin@example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1407]: This address is used for admin purposes.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1408]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1409]: Membership\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1414] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - checkbox [ref=f3e1415]\n                      - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1416]\n                      - generic [ref=f3e1417]:\n                        - text: Anyone can register\n                        - paragraph [ref=f3e1418]: Allow public user registration on the site.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1419]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1420]: When Public Registration Is Off\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1424]:\n                      - radiogroup \"registrationMode\" [ref=f3e1425]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1426] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1427]:\n                            - radio [checked] [ref=f3e1428]\n                            - radio [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1430]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1431]: Invite-only\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1433] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1434]:\n                            - radio [ref=f3e1435]\n                            - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1436]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1437]: Closed\n                      - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1439]: invite_only\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1440]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1441]: New User Default Role\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1445]:\n                      - combobox \"New User Default Role\" [ref=f3e1446]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1447]: subscriber\n                        - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1448]: ▼\n                      - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1450]: subscriber\n              - generic [ref=f3e1451]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1454]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1455]: Password Notifications\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1456]: Control email notifications related to password r