 main [ref=f3e1309]:\n          - navigation \"Breadcrumb\" [ref=f3e1310]:\n            - list [ref=f3e1311]:\n              - listitem [ref=f3e1312]:\n                - link \"Dashboard\" [ref=f3e1313] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /dashboard\n              - listitem [ref=f3e1314]:\n                - link \"Settings\" [ref=f3e1317] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /settings\n              - listitem [ref=f3e1318]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1321]: General\n          - generic [ref=f3e1322]:\n            - generic [ref=f3e1323]:\n              - heading \"General Settings\" [level=1] [ref=f3e1324]\n              - paragraph [ref=f3e1325]: Configure your site's basic information and display preferences.\n            - generic [ref=f3e1326]:\n              - generic [ref=f3e1327]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1330]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1331]: Site Identity\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1332]: Your site's name and tagline.\n                - group \"Site Identity\" [ref=f3e1336]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1337]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1339]:\n                      - text: Site Title\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1340]: \"*\"\n                    - textbox \"Site Title\" [ref=f3e1345]:\n                      - /placeholder: My Site\n                      - text: Summit Main — Live\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1346]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1347]: Tagline\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1349]:\n                      - textbox \"Tagline\" [active] [ref=f3e1353]:\n                        - /placeholder: Just another ConvexPress site\n                        - text: Just another ConvexPress site\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1354]: In a few words, explain what this site is about.\n              - generic [ref=f3e1355]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1358]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1359]: Site Address\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1360]: The URLs where your site is accessible.\n                - group \"Site Address\" [ref=f3e1364]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1365]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1367]:\n                      - text: Site Address (URL)\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1368]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1369]:\n                      - textbox \"Site Address (URL)\" [ref=f3e1373]:\n                        - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1374]: The URL where ConvexPress's core files reside.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1375]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1377]:\n                      - text: Home Address (URL)\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1378]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1379]:\n                      - textbox \"Home Address (URL)\" [ref=f3e1383]:\n                        - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1384]: The address visitors use to reach your site.\n                  - note [ref=f3e1385]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1388]: These URLs should only be changed if you know what you're doing. In most cases, the Site Address and Home Address should be the same.\n              - generic [ref=f3e1389]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1390]: Administration\n                - group \"Administration\" [ref=f3e1397]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1398]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1400]:\n                      - text: Administration Email\n                      - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1401]: \"*\"\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1402]:\n                      - textbox \"Administration Email\" [ref=f3e1406]:\n                        - /placeholder: admin@example.com\n                      - paragraph [ref=f3e1407]: This address is used for admin purposes.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1408]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1409]: Membership\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1414] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - checkbox [ref=f3e1415]\n                      - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1416]\n                      - generic [ref=f3e1417]:\n                        - text: Anyone can register\n                        - paragraph [ref=f3e1418]: Allow public user registration on the site.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1419]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1420]: When Public Registration Is Off\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1424]:\n                      - radiogroup \"registrationMode\" [ref=f3e1425]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1426] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1427]:\n                            - radio [checked] [ref=f3e1428]\n                            - radio [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1430]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1431]: Invite-only\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1433] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1434]:\n                            - radio [ref=f3e1435]\n                            - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1436]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1437]: Closed\n                      - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1439]: invite_only\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1440]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1441]: New User Default Role\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1445]:\n                      - combobox \"New User Default Role\" [ref=f3e1446]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1447]: subscriber\n                        - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1448]: ▼\n                      - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1450]: subscriber\n              - generic [ref=f3e1451]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1454]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1455]: Password Notifications\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1456]: Control email notifications related to password resets and changes.\n                - group \"Password Notifications\" [ref=f3e1460]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1461]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1462]: Password Reset Request\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1467] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - checkbox [ref=f3e1468]\n                      - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1469]\n                      - generic [ref=f3e1470]:\n                        - text: Send a branded reset email\n                        - paragraph [ref=f3e1471]: Send a ConvexPress-branded password reset email in addition to the default authentication provider email.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1472]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1473]: Password Changed Confirmation\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1478] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - checkbox [checked] [ref=f3e1479]\n                      - checkbox [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1483]\n                      - generic [ref=f3e1484]:\n                        - text: Send confirmation when password changes\n                        - paragraph [ref=f3e1485]: Notify the user via email when their password has been successfully changed.\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1486]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1487]: Admin Notification\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1492] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - checkbox [ref=f3e1493]\n                      - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1494]\n                      - generic [ref=f3e1495]:\n                        - text: Notify administrator on password reset\n                        - paragraph [ref=f3e1496]: Send an email to the administration email address whenever any user resets their password.\n              - generic [ref=f3e1497]:\n                - generic [ref=f3e1500]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1501]: Locale\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1502]: Language, timezone, and date/time display settings.\n                - group \"Locale\" [ref=f3e1506]:\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1507]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1508]: Site Language\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1512]:\n                      - combobox \"Site Language\" [ref=f3e1513]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1514]: en-US\n                        - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1515]: ▼\n                      - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1517]: en-US\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1518]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1519]: Timezone\n                    - button \"America/New_York (Eastern)\" [ref=f3e1524]\n                  - generic [ref=f3e1529]:\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1530]: Date Format\n                    - generic [ref=f3e1534]:\n                      - radiogroup \"dateFormat\" [ref=f3e1535]:\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1536] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1537]:\n                            - radio [checked] [ref=f3e1538]\n                            - radio [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1540]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1541]: MMMM d, yyyy\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1543] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1544]:\n                            - radio [ref=f3e1545]\n                            - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1546]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1547]: MM/dd/yyyy\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1549] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1550]:\n                            - radio [ref=f3e1551]\n                            - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1552]\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1553]: dd/MM/yyyy\n                        - generic [ref=f3e1555] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - generic [ref=f3e1556]:\n                            - radio [ref=f3e1557]\n                            - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f3e1558]\n